"""Source-linked original incident/execution CGs. Built-in imagegen only."""
from pathlib import Path
import json,hashlib
ROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1];D=ROOT/'docs/design/rewrite_v4';OUT=ROOT/'art/v4_production/full/builtin_jobs'
existing=json.loads((ROOT/'art/v4_production/full/builtin_jobs.json').read_text(encoding='utf8'))
refs={}
for j in existing['jobs']:
    for slug,p in zip(j['characters'],j['references']):refs[slug]=p
base=('Use case: illustration-story / identity-preserve. One original mystery visual novel CG, full-bleed16:9 widescreen target1920x1080. '
      'Image1 is EXACT character identity and angular INK/CEL STYLE reference. New narrative pose, preserve face, eye color, hair silhouette/accessories and exact uniform. '
      'Fine variable black contours, detailed hair strands and cloth folds, clean hard cel shadows; no generic soft anime redesign or shiny photoreal skin. '
      'Essential face/hands/clues in upper70% with safe margin above hair, lower25% only continuous scene for dialogue overlay; do NOT draw UI. '
      'NO text, logos, watermarks or new evidence. Fully clothed, nonsexual, no exposure. Violence restrained and NON-GRAPHIC: purple blood only, no red blood, no open wounds, exposed tissue, organs, bones or dismemberment. '
      'Do not copy any existing franchise character, execution set or plot. These are original authored project scenes. ')
jobs=[]
def add(ident,source,slug,scene,kind='incident',space=None):
    paths=list(D.glob(source+'*.md'));assert len(paths)==1,(source,paths)
    src=paths[0];reference=[refs[slug]]
    environment=''
    if space:
        p=ROOT/f'Game/Saved/v4-world-full-v2/{space}.png';assert p.exists()
        reference.append(p.relative_to(ROOT).as_posix())
        environment='Image2 is the AUTHORED 3D SPACE/PERSPECTIVE reference. Render its same architecture in ink/cel illustration; do not paste a 3D screenshot. Preserve the described exact incident object state rather than blindly copying a normal-state door/lid. '
    j={'id':ident+'_builtin_r1','source':src.relative_to(ROOT).as_posix(),'source_sha256':hashlib.sha256(src.read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'characters':[slug],'references':reference,'prompt':base+environment+scene,'kind':kind,'visual_status':'not generated','runtime_integrated':False}
    (OUT/(j['id']+'.json')).write_text(json.dumps(j,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n',encoding='utf8');jobs.append(j)

add('incident_c1','11a3_1장_','kaede','After death confirmed, Kaede lies collapsed on FLOOR beside an interior chair in the service lounge, one slack hand near own neck, the other hand partly underneath CRUMPLED blank paper. Long navy hair and light blue long coat/cream long skirt from reference. Pale unresponsive face, slightly open unfocused eyes and slack mouth, head hangs at an unbraced angle, weight actually on floor, NOT peaceful sleeping or elegant posing. Non-graphic dark pressure bruising on side of neck is visible without cuts or gore; no blood pool, no rope or weapon. One partly damp blank paper lies separately near switched-ON small printer; printer has only a tiny green indicator, no letters. No other people. Full body diagonal three-quarter view, injury and papers readable by shapes, never add a clue.','incident','service_lounge_center')
add('incident_c2','12a7_2장_','ai','After death confirmed, mint-bob cook Ai lies unnaturally folded inside a large BLUE rectangular wheeled stage equipment CHEST, lid fully OPEN held by TWO lid stays, two external metal latches released. Body rests heavily against bottom, no active movement or calm sleeping face: pallid unresponsive face with slightly open unfocused eyes, slack mouth. Small NON-GRAPHIC temple bruise and purple stain on hair/cloth, no open wound. One slack hand holds a tiny broken BLACK PLASTIC loop fragment with a small attached black cord segment, clearly not metal chain. Ordinary stage weights remain separate in chest bottom; a plain cloth covers legs modestly without hiding head/hand/weight positions. No weapon or murderer shown, no magic, no invented lock inside chest. Three-quarter overhead camera, full chest and floor wheels visible.','incident','hotel_multiuse_center')
add('incident_c3a','13a12_3장_','riku','After death confirmed, orange-haired magician Riku has collapsed on floor BETWEEN WALL AND WORKBENCH in mirror-maze work alcove. Black uniform, hat displaced beside him, cape rests under part of body. Neck-area NON-GRAPHIC purple staining spreads across CLOSED shirt front; no open injury, gore or knife in frame. No sleeping: eyes partly open and unfocused, face pale, mouth slack, one arm has fallen with gravity, head unsupported. Small ordinary blank marker pieces scattered on floor, no playing-card clues or magic effects. Mirror at oblique angle reflects only partial ROOM geometry, not a second body or extra person. Keep body/workbench/wall relationships clear.','incident','mirror_workbay_center')
add('incident_c3b','13b2_3장_','sora','After emergency response and death confirmed, blond orange-jacketed Sora ORIGINAL BODY remains on ordinary WAITING-ROOM BENCH, not another character body. All costume, red headband and blond hair exactly image1; no silver hair. One arm hangs slack beside bench; body limp and pallid, eyes partly open unfocused and mouth slack, no peaceful sleep. Small NON-GRAPHIC purple stain at collar/cloth covering side of neck; no open wound or blade. A plain treatment cloth is laid to side of injury, NOT whole-body shroud. No assailant, witnesses, supernatural aura or identity-swap overlay. Wide three-quarter view includes empty floor and closed ordinary door, no direct doorway to control room. Use a BENCH, replace the bed-like normal placeholder in image2 with bench proportions.','incident','mirror_waiting_center')
add('incident_c4','14b1_4장_','haruka','After rescue attempt and death confirmed, pink-bob Haruka lies limp and unresponsive on inspection-hall FLOOR beside an OPEN metal water-tank hatch. Soaked cream blazer, pink bow, long skirt area covered modestly by plain treatment cloth. Pallid face, partly open unfocused brown eyes, slack jaw and gravity-set head, no peaceful sleeping. Tiny NON-GRAPHIC purple bruising/stains at forehead and one hand, no gore, no stab wound. Wet bag separately at side, puddle/wet trail from open hatch. Head and hurt hand remain visible; no emergency responder or killer in frame. Wide sober eye-level/raised three-quarter discovery composition, physically real floor contact and tank opening; no nakedness or disappearance.','incident','inspection_hall_changed_center')
add('incident_c5','15a11_5장_','koto','After emergency response and death confirmed, long-blonde-haired organizer Koto lies limp on lounge FLOOR beside pushed-back chair and table. Preserve reference navy long skirt, cream cardigan and red armband. Pallid unresponsive face, eyes and mouth slightly open, head unsupported, both hands slack, no peaceful sleep. Old elbow bandage has only a SMALL existing purple stain; NO large blood pool, no mouth foam, new weapon or imagined poisoning vial. One nearly empty plain tea CUP stands UNDISTURBED on table, plain allocation paper has fallen to floor. No readable text or medical diagram. No other characters; compose body and cup in one coherent perspective, full clothing and gravity contact, somber unembellished light.','incident','service_lounge_center')

